cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RustKVM in research or a publication, please cite it as below."
title: "RustKVM: open-source KVM-over-IP for RK3588, written in Rust"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The RustKVM contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Rust-KVM/rustkvm"
url: "https://github.com/Rust-KVM/rustkvm"
license: GPL-2.0-only
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  RustKVM turns an RK3588 board into an IP-KVM: hardware-encoded H.264/H.265 video
  over WebRTC, USB keyboard and mouse emulation, virtual media, ATX and DC power
  control, and JSON-RPC, MQTT and Model Context Protocol (MCP) interfaces for
  automation and AI agents.
keywords:
  - kvm-over-ip
  - ip-kvm
  - rk3588
  - rust
  - webrtc
  - remote-access
  - mcp
